          "reading": "[haː.ðaː ʔa.biː‿l.faː.dˤil, wa.ðaː.li.ka ʕam.miː‿l.ka.biː.ru‿l.la.ðiː ja.ʕiː.ʃu fiː‿l.qaː.hi.rah] (Hā-dhā a-bī al-fā-ḍil, wa-dhā-li-ka ʿam-mī al-ka-bī-ru al-la-dhī ya-ʿī-shu fī al-Qā-hi-rah.)",
