          "reading": "[ʃa.ri.ba‿dˤ.dˤu.juː.fu‿l.qah.wa.ta‿l.ʕa.ra.bij.jah, wa.ʔa.ka.luː‿t.tam.ra‿l.la.ðiːð] (Sha-ri-ba aḍ-ḍu-yū-fu al-qah-wa-ta al-ʿa-ra-biy-yah, wa-a-ka-lū at-tam-ra al-la-dhīdh.)",
