          "reading": "[mar.ħa.ban ħu.saːm, kaj.fa taq.dˤiː ʔaw.qaː.ta fa.raː.ɣi.ka fiː‿n.naː.diː‿r.ri.jaː.dˤijj?] (Mar-ḥa-ban Ḥu-sām, kay-fa taq-ḍī aw-qā-ta fa-rā-ghi-ka fī an-nā-dī ar-ri-yā-ḍiyy?)",
