          "reading": "[zaː.ra‿l.baː.ħi.θu‿l.mak.ta.ba.ta zi.jaː.ra.tan tˤa.wiː.la.tan sˤa.baː.ħa‿l.jaw.mi raɣ.ba.tan fiː‿l.baħ.θi wan.bi.laː.ʒa‿sˤ.sˤubħ] (Zā-ra al-bā-ḥi-thu al-mak-ta-ba-ta zi-yā-ra-tan ṭa-wī-la-tan ṣa-bā-ḥa al-yaw-mi ragh-ba-tan fī al-baḥ-thi wa-an-bi-lā-ja aṣ-ṣubḥ.)",
