          "reading": "[maː qa.raʔ.tu ɣaj.ra ki.taː.bin waː.ħi.din wa.maː naː.la‿l.ʒaː.ʔi.za.ta si.waː‿l.mu.ta.faw.wi.qi‿l.mu.θaː.bir] (Mā qa-raʾ-tu ghay-ra ki-tā-bin wā-ḥi-din wa-mā nā-la al-jā-ʾi-za-ta si-wā al-mu-ta-faw-wi-qi al-mu-thā-bir.)",
